{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03767","headline":"和韦承庆过义阳公主山池五首 二 · 杜审言","name":"和韦承庆过义阳公主山池五首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迳转危峰逼，桥回缺岸妨。\n玉泉移酒味，石髓换粳香。\n绾雾青丝弱，牵风紫蔓长。\n犹言宴乐少，别向後池塘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜审言","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03767.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03767","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}